---
/**
 * Shared footer for /match/ and /match/thank-you/.
 * Not-a-lender, business purpose, routing, compensation, verify-at-NMLS, Equal
 * Housing Opportunity (never "Lender": neither the directory nor a broker is one).
 * Matched-specialist licensing blocks are NOT here by project rule; the thank-you
 * island renders the matched broker's block itself.
 */
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-linen-deep border-t border-hair">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 py-10 lg:px-10">
    <p class="text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
      DSCRBroker.com is a free matching service, not a lender, bank, or mortgage broker. It does not
      take loan applications or make loan decisions. For loans on non-owner-occupied investment
      property only. Your information goes to one licensed loan originator, chosen by the state the
      property is in. DSCRBroker.com is paid by the loan originator for each introduction; you pay
      nothing for the match. Verify any originator at NMLS Consumer Access.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-4 flex items-start gap-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
      <svg class="h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0 fill-ink-muted" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-label="Equal Housing Opportunity">
        <path d="M12 2L2 10h3v10h14V10h3L12 2zm0 2.84L18 10v10H6V10l6-5.16zM11 12h2v6h-2v-6z" />
      </svg>
      <p>
        Equal Housing Opportunity. Loans arranged through participating licensed originators are
        available regardless of race, color, religion, national origin, sex, handicap, or familial
        status, in accordance with the Fair Housing Act.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-[12px] text-ink-muted">
      <a href="/privacy-policy/" class="m-link">Privacy</a>
      <a href="/terms-of-service/" class="m-link">Terms</a>
      <a href="https://www.nmlsconsumeraccess.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="m-link">NMLS Consumer Access</a>
      <span class="ml-auto">&copy; {year} DSCRBroker.com</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
